{"t":"005930.KS","n":"Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd.","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":189400.0,"chg":11900.0,"chgPct":0.06704,"prev":177500.0,"dayH":193700.0,"dayL":187500.0,"w52H":374500.0,"w52L":96200.0,"vol":17322903,"avgVol":16484570,"mcap":1233359049064448,"pe":null,"fpe":2.43,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":18404.0,"divY":0.1037,"beta":1.58,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Technology","sKo":"기술","i":"Consumer Electronics","iKo":"가전제품","city":"Suwon-si","emp":null,"web":"https://www.samsung.com","sum":"Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd. engages in the consumer electronics, information technology and mobile communications, and device solutions businesses worldwide. The company operates through four divisions: Device eXperience (DX), Device Solutions (DS), SDC, and Harman. The company offers smartphones, tablets, audio sounds, watches, switches, and accessories; TVs, and sound devices; appliances, including refrigerators, washing machines and dryers, vacuum cleaners, cooking appliances, dishwashers, air conditioners, and air purifiers; monitors and memory storage products; displays, and smart and LED signages; and other accessories. It also engages in venture capital investments, cloud services, network devices installation, semiconductor equipment services, digital advertising platforms, marke","sumKo":"삼성전자주식회사는 전 세계적으로 가전제품, 정보 기술, 모바일 통신, 장치 솔루션 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 DX(Device eXperience), DS(Device Solutions), SDC 및 Harman의 4개 부문으로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 스마트폰, 태블릿, 오디오 사운드, 시계, 스위치 및 액세서리를 제공합니다. TV 및 음향기기 냉장고, 세탁기 및 건조기, 진공청소기, 조리기구, 식기세척기, 에어컨, 공기청정기를 포함한 가전제품; 모니터 및 메모리 저장 제품; 디스플레이, 스마트 및 LED 간판; 및 기타 액세서리. 또한 벤처 캐피탈 투자, 클라우드 서비스, 네트워크 장치 설치, 반도체 장비 서비스, 디지털 광고 플랫폼, 시장에 종사합니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":302230000000000,"ni":54730000000000},{"y":2023,"rev":258935500000000,"ni":14473400000000},{"y":2024,"rev":300870000000000,"ni":33621400000000},{"y":2025,"rev":333605900000000,"ni":44261000000000}],"quart